                    briefing_1:         `You have identified a 6,000 m\u00B2 former industrial site adjacent to the new Ciudadela Metro station. The site is zoned for mixed-use development. The market shows: 2.1M population growing at 2.3%, residential vacancy at 6.2%, retail vacancy at 14.8%, office vacancy at 22%. Bank lending rate is 9.5%.<br><br>Decide your land bid, program allocation, and how deeply to study the market before committing capital.`,
                    briefing_2:         `Your land acquisition is complete. You must now secure planning approvals. Community groups are monitoring new developments near the metro station. Entitlement risk is real: delays add carrying costs to your land investment.<br><br>Choose your community engagement approach and architect to navigate the approval process.`,
